#quiet numbers-m numbers-m.quiet.f32 96600 15.24
punctuation-f expr-voice-2-f 33 1.2 40 punctuation-f.ids 87600 punctuation-f.f32 87600 18.89 Wait... really? Fine; let's talk!
#quiet punctuation-f punctuation-f.quiet.f32 87600 16.01
